        "comments": "Assembly Name: GRCz11 Primary Assembly\nThe GRCz11 sequence is composed of genomic sequence, primarily finished clones that were sequenced as part of Zebrafish Genome Project at the Wellcome Trust Sanger Institute. PCR products and WGS shotgun sequence from mainly the WGS31 assembly (CABZ00000000.1) but also WGS29 (CAAK00000000.1) and WGS32 (CZQB00000000.1) have been added where necessary to fill gaps. In addition, unplaced sequences from WGS31 were added if they featured at least 5 kb of non-repetitive sequence, or if alignments with a cDNA could be detected that were not already covered by the placed sequences. For more information see: https://genomereference.org.",
